This tracked regular file intentionally prevents Cargo from creating a
checkout-local target directory when Cargo is launched outside this repository
with only --manifest-path and therefore does not discover .cargo/config.toml.

Run Cargo from the repository, use the sanctioned Make targets, or set an
explicit external CARGO_TARGET_DIR. Persistent development artifacts belong in
../.ryuki-target-ryuki.io; disposable verification artifacts are managed by
scripts/verify-workspace-clean.sh.
